            "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Madam Ch'en has a lot of pride, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Hmm? Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Don't worry..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I know... Rhodes Island will be fighting alone again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But, it's too early to be feeling down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Come on, Jessica and the others are still waiting for us."
    },
